616
00:27:17,092 --> 00:27:18,231
bu dağları aşağı

617
00:27:18,231 --> 00:27:18,632
gelecek?

618
00:27:19,352 --> 00:27:19,652
Bakın

619
00:27:19,652 --> 00:27:20,352
bu Kafkas

620
00:27:20,352 --> 00:27:21,432
