633
00:27:33,352 --> 00:27:34,231
Deniz yoluyla

634
00:27:34,231 --> 00:27:35,271
Trabzon'a geliyorlar,

635
00:27:35,372 --> 00:27:36,291
Trabzon Limon'dan

636
00:27:36,291 --> 00:27:36,832
iniyorlar.

637
00:27:37,251 --> 00:27:38,052
Trabzon Limon'dan

638
00:27:38,052 --> 00:27:38,451
sonra işte

639
00:27:38,451 --> 00:27:39,672
hayvanlarla

640
00:27:39,672 --> 00:27:40,552
